      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Idea to storyboard to video**\n\nFollow the numbered frames from left to right.\n\n1. **Your key** (first time only): paste your HashBidX key and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key.\n2. **Your idea**: type your idea into **Shot Writer** and set the length and the number of shots. A HashBidX text model writes the shot list.\n3. **The shot list**: the text that was written shows here.\n4. **Make the video**: films the shot list as one clip. The prompt and the duration come in over the two lines.\n5. **Result**: press **Run**. The clip plays here.\n\nNot happy with the shots? Press **Run** again for a new version, or copy the text into the video box and edit it by hand. The text model costs a fraction of a cent per run.\n\nThe key box is wired to the first HashBidX box. The other HashBidX boxes use the same saved key."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**Idea to storyboard to video**\n\nFollow the numbered frames from left to right.\n\n1. **Your key** (first time only): paste your HashBidX key and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key.\n2. **Your idea**: type your idea into **Shot Writer** and set the length and the number of shots. A HashBidX text model writes the shot list.\n3. **The shot list**: the text that was written shows here.\n4. **Make the video**: films the shot list as one clip. The prompt and the duration come in over the two lines.\n5. **Result**: press **Run**. The clip plays here.\n\nNot happy with the shots? Press **Run** again for a new version, or copy the text into the video box and edit it by hand. The text model costs a fraction of a cent per run.\n\nThe key box is wired to the first HashBidX box. The other HashBidX boxes use the same saved key."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
